m:modified>Sun, 10 Apr 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E5%A4%A7%E9%81%93%E7%9C%9F%E4%BC%A0%E5%8F%A3%E8%AF%80/</guid><description>摘要 正文 后记.txt 大道真传口诀第一讲.txt 大道真传口诀第三讲.txt 大道真传口诀第二讲.txt 大道真传口诀第五讲.txt 大道真传口诀第六</description><dc:creator>西蜀魏尧</dc:creator><category>大道真传口诀</category><category>西蜀魏尧</category><category>丹道</category><category>道</category><category>道</category><category>丹道</category><category>经文</category></item><item><title>《太乙金华宗旨》集要(最简)</title><link>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E5%A4%AA%E4%B9%99%E9%87%91%E5%8D%8E%E5%AE%97%E6%97%A8%E9%9B%86%E8%A6%81/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E5%A4%AA%E4%B9%99%E9%87%91%E5%8D%8E%E5%AE%97%E6%97%A8%E9%9B%86%E8%A6%81/</guid><description>一、实修功法 概要： 1、回光之功，全用逆法，注想天心，天心居曰月中。 2、诸子只去回光，便是无上妙谛。光易动而难定，回之既久，此光凝结，即是自然</description><dc:creator>Om</dc:creator><category>太乙金华宗旨</category><category>吕洞宾</category><category>纯阳真人</category><category>摘要</category><category>丹道</category><category>道</category><category>道</category><category>丹道</category></item><item><title>黄庭内景经</title><link>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E9%BB%84%E5%BA%AD%E5%86%85%E6%99%AF%E7%BB%8F/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E9%BB%84%E5%BA%AD%E5%86%85%E6%99%AF%E7%BB%8F/</guid><description>上清章第一 上清紫霞虚皇前，太上大道玉晨君。闲居蕊珠作七言，散化五形变万神。 是为黄庭曰内篇，琴心三叠舞胎仙。九气映明出霄间，神盖童子生紫烟。 是</description><dc:creator>Om</dc:creator><category>黄庭经</category><category>丹道</category><category>道</category><category>道</category><category>经文</category></item><item><title>黄庭外景经</title><link>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E9%BB%84%E5%BA%AD%E5%A4%96%E6%99%AF%E7%BB%8F/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E9%BB%84%E5%BA%AD%E5%A4%96%E6%99%AF%E7%BB%8F/</guid><description>上部经第一 老君闲居作七言，解说身形及诸神。上有黄庭下关元，后有幽阙前命门。 呼吸庐间入丹田，玉池清水灌灵根。审能修之可长存，黄庭中人衣朱衣。 关</description><dc:creator>Om</dc:creator><category>黄庭经</category><category>丹道</category><category>道</category><category>道</category><category>经文</category></item><item><title>黄庭中景经</title><link>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E9%BB%84%E5%BA%AD%E4%B8%AD%E6%99%AF%E7%BB%8F/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E9%BB%84%E5%BA%AD%E4%B8%AD%E6%99%AF%E7%BB%8F/</guid><description>念吾头顶戴天神 发为星辰万余纶 纡长槃屈光若玄 顶上中央名通天 孔德之容大如钱 天星和气从此间 养人骨髓浸灵根 下和六府绍五宫 消除恶气出脐门 还念两目白黑分</description><dc:creator>Om</dc:creator><category>黄庭经</category><category>丹道</category><category>道</category><category>道</category><category>经文</category></item><item><title>金花的秘密</title><link>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E9%87%91%E8%8A%B1%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E9%87%91%E8%8A%B1%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86/</guid><description>译者按：《太乙金华宗旨》共有十三章，卫礼贤只翻译了前八章，且有个别段落没有译出来，后面五章卫礼贤觉得价值没有那么大而未译出。《慧命经》全书共</description><dc:creator>Om</dc:creator><category>金花的秘密</category><category>太乙金华宗旨</category><category>吕洞宾</category><category>纯阳真人</category><category>丹道</category><category>道</category><category>道</category><category>经文</category><category>丹道</category></item><item><title>太乙金华宗旨-道藏续编</title><link>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E5%A4%AA%E4%B9%99%E9%87%91%E5%8D%8E%E5%AE%97%E6%97%A8/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E5%A4%AA%E4%B9%99%E9%87%91%E5%8D%8E%E5%AE%97%E6%97%A8/</guid><description>金华宗旨序 道在目前，身体自得，何劳身外寻求哉。人身为三才合一之身，造物赋我，其用甚大。我人日具而不知，圣人悯之，征诸一身以示之。盖谓道在一身</description><dc:creator>Om</dc:creator><category>太乙金华宗旨</category><category>吕洞宾</category><category>纯阳真人</category><category>丹道</category><category>道</category><category>道</category><category>经文</category><category>丹道</category></item><item><title>周易参同契笺注合刊</title><link>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E5%91%A8%E6%98%93%E5%8F%82%E5%90%8C%E5%A5%91%E7%AC%BA%E6%B3%A8%E5%90%88%E5%88%8A/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E9%81%93/%E4%B8%B9%E9%81%93/%E5%91%A8%E6%98%93%E5%8F%82%E5%90%8C%E5%A5%91%E7%AC%BA%E6%B3%A8%E5%90%88%E5%88%8A/</guid><description>大易总叙章第一 乾坤者，易之门户，众卦之父母。坎离匡廓，运毂正轴，牝牡四卦，以为橐钥。覆冒阴阳之道，尤工御者准绳墨，执衔辔，正规距，随轨辙，处</description><dc:creator>Om</dc:creator><category>周易参同契</category><category>丹道</category><category>道</category><category>丹道</category><category>道</category><category>经文</category></item></channel></rss>